This is a fork of LAMMPS.

The fork supports ordinary non-spin molecular dynamics simulations and adds
optional Newtonian variable-magnitude spin dynamics for DeePMD. Standard
non-spin nve, nvt, npt, and nph simulations retain the ordinary LAMMPS
integration path. Classical simulations use the usual LAMMPS packages and
build instructions; DeePMD-kit is required only for its corresponding
interfaces.

Use the official LAMMPS build and simulation documentation linked below for
ordinary simulations. NEWTONIAN_SPIN.md describes the optional spin
functionality, supported models, and installation procedure.

Compatibility note: nve/spin and langevin/spin implement Newtonian dynamics
in this fork. Upstream fixed-magnitude precession inputs using these styles
require adaptation.

LAMMPS stands for Large-scale Atomic/Molecular Massively Parallel
Simulator.

Copyright (2003) Sandia Corporation.  Under the terms of Contract
DE-AC04-94AL85000 with Sandia Corporation, the U.S. Government retains
